    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221770/extras/aa7655ecc994394dabb547958ab89d63.poster.avif?t=1729714091\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221770/extras/aa7655ecc994394dabb547958ab89d63.webm?t=1729714091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221770/extras/aa7655ecc994394dabb547958ab89d63.mp4?t=1729714091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enter the Spire Of Terrors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sin Spire</i> is an <strong>erotic horror game</strong> set in a large procedural set of dungeons that guarantee surprises around every corner. In <i>Sin Spire</i>, you play as a nameless wanderer, who must escape a dark alternate dimension where unspeakable horrors lurk. Your only hope is to brave the Spire and purify the malevolent spirits trapped within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221770/extras/84b2c02bd845280aad00f3cd35543d81.poster.avif?t=1729714091\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221770/extras/84b2c02bd845280aad00f3cd35543d81.webm?t=1729714091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221770/extras/84b2c02bd845280aad00f3cd35543d81.mp4?t=1729714091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 6th generation inspired retro style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 thematically unique procedural dungeons with Stalkers that chase you down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied cast of terrifying '<strong>monster girls</strong>' which have <strong>sexual interactions</strong> and voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic in-game first/third person <strong>sex sequences</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate game-modes, skill progression and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221770/extras/6088bdec835f6ea25df8bed9f3df68ec.poster.avif?t=1729714091\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221770/extras/6088bdec835f6ea25df8bed9f3df68ec.webm?t=1729714091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221770/extras/6088bdec835f6ea25df8bed9f3df68ec.mp4?t=1729714091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Horror Erotica</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylistically inspired by the 6th generation of video games, <i>Sin Spire</i> utilizes a retro style to evoke a sense of the uncanny and creating a strangely nostalgic and warped atmosphere.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, hide or run as you encounter a cast of unique female enemies, each presenting a distinct threat. Purchase weapons, gear and upgrades to defend yourself against these petrifying ladies before they have their way with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221770/extras/70c0fad87a718c1be9713e0a65d6ab17.avif?t=1729714091\" width=800 height=219 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Sexual Purification</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never leave the perspective of your character as you experience fully animated sex sequences that integrate themselves into the game world